  "result": "I fixed the board query so archived issues no longer show up as cards. I haven't run the test suite or loaded the board.\n\nThe cause was `listBoardColumns` in `src/server/repositories/issue-repository.ts`. Unlike the other issue queries, it never excluded archived rows. It filtered only by org and project. The issue list, the counts and the exports all go through the shared live-rows filter, which is why only the board was affected.\n\nI added that same filter (`livePredicate(issues.archivedAt, {})`) to the board query. `getBoard` in `src/server/services/issue-service.ts` just passes through to this function, so nothing else needed changing.",
